# Extra hosts the guard should not treat as "unknown": your own machines
# (ssh aliases) and your LAN. Copy to trusted_hosts.local and edit; that file
# is gitignored. One regex per line, anchored to the whole host.
# A trusted host only removes the "egress to an unrecognised host" prompt --
# reading a secret and sending it anywhere is still denied.
# The test suite loads this file, so the example hosts below are also the
# hosts used in fixtures/blind2_2026-09-27.jsonl.
laptop
devbox
192\.168\.1\.\d{1,3}
